What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Vehicle {
    public Vehicle() {
        System.out.print("V");
    }
    public Vehicle(int w) {
        this();
        System.out.print("V" + w);
    }
}

class Car extends Vehicle {
    public Car() {
        System.out.print("C");
    }
    public Car(int w) {
        super(w);
        System.out.print("C" + w);
    }
}

class Taxi extends Car {
    public Taxi() {
        this(4);
        System.out.print("T");
    }
    public Taxi(int w) {
        System.out.print("T" + w);
    }
}
```

```java
new Taxi();
System.out.print("|");
new Car(2);
System.out.println();
```

