What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Employee {
    private String name;
    private double base;
    public Employee(String n, double b) {
        name = n;
        base = b;
    }
    public String getName() {
        return name;
    }
    public double pay() {
        return base;
    }
    public String toString() {
        return name + ":" + pay();
    }
}

class Manager extends Employee {
    private int reports;
    public Manager(String n, double b, int r) {
        super(n, b);
        reports = r;
    }
    public double pay() {
        return super.pay() + 100 * reports;
    }
}

class Intern extends Employee {
    public Intern(String n) {
        super(n, 500);
    }
    public double pay() {
        return super.pay() / 2;
    }
    public String toString() {
        return "Intern " + super.toString();
    }
}
```

```java
ArrayList<Employee> staff = new ArrayList<Employee>();
staff.add(new Employee("Ann", 1000));
staff.add(new Manager("Bo", 2000, 3));
staff.add(new Intern("Cy"));
double total = 0;
for (Employee e : staff)
    total += e.pay();
System.out.println(total + " " + staff.get(1) + " " + staff.get(2));
```

