What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Counter {
    private int n = 0;
    public void inc() {
        n += step();
    }
    public int step() {
        return 1;
    }
    public int get() {
        return n;
    }
}

class Skipper extends Counter {
    public int step() {
        return 2;
    }
    public void inc() {
        super.inc();
        super.inc();
    }
}
```

```java
Counter c = new Skipper();
c.inc();
c.inc();
System.out.println(c.get() + " " + c.step());
```

