What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Meter {
    private int v;
    public Meter(int v) {
        this.v = v;
    }
    public int get() {
        return v;
    }
    public void bump() {
        v += 10;
    }
}

class Odometer extends Meter {
    public Odometer(int v) {
        super(v * 2);
    }
    public int get() {
        return super.get() + 1;
    }
}

class Trip extends Odometer {
    public Trip(int v) {
        super(v + 1);
    }
    public void bump() {
        super.bump();
        super.bump();
    }
}
```

```java
Meter m = new Trip(3);
m.bump();
System.out.println(m.get());
```
